on."],"35":["What is Sadao's reward that evening?","What does he see, or fail to see, on the island?","There is no signal. Sadao believes Tom has escaped safely."],"41":["Why is Sadao's memory of his landlady complicated?","Think about how she helped him and how he felt about her.","She cared for him when he was ill, yet he still found it hard to feel grateful to her."],"45":["What question does Sadao still carry at the end?","Compare his feelings about Americans with what he did for Tom.","He still sees Tom as an enemy and wonders why he could not kill him. His actions and his beliefs do not fit together."]}}
